### Dataviv AI OS — manual API checks (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
### Paste a token printed by `make seed` / task "3 · Seed dev data".
@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_PARTNER_TOKEN_HERE

GET {{base}}/health

###
GET {{base}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/v1/matters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/v1/matters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rao v. Union of India — writ petition",
  "client_name": "S. Rao",
  "matter_type": "litigation",
  "forum": "Supreme Court of India",
  "practice_area": "Constitutional"
